            "full_chain_observation": "registered item/custom entity/event: Actual EvilCraft config list creates normal and empowered InvertedPotentia, lightning grenade and item_empowerable entity. ItemConfig/EntityConfig shared factories and register/getRender pipeline reused exactly. New CommonProxy.registerEventHooks registers EntityStruckByLightningEventHook; ClientProxy constructs delegated CommonProxy and Core ClientProxyComponent forwards registerEventHooks. Existing ModBase setup calls actual selected proxy. No explicit server guard in empowerItem hook itself; native event dispatch/thread not inferred from grenade source.
